---
// No imports needed
---

<!-- Hero -->
<header class="min-h-screen flex items-center px-6 pt-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decoración Sutil: Coordenadas de Asunción -->
    <div class="absolute right-[-5%] top-[20%] rotate-90 font-mono text-[15vh] text-neutral-900 font-black select-none opacity-20">
        25.2637° S
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6" data-aos="fade-right">
            <span class="font-mono text-accent text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Tech & Creative Studio</span>
            <span class="h-px w-12 bg-neutral-800"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500 text-xs">Asunción, PY</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-[9rem] font-black leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter mb-12" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
            Mbarete<br>
            <span class="text-neutral-800 tracking-widest uppercase text-[0.4em] block mt-4">Code & Design</span>
            Systems<span class="text-accent">.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-8">
            <p class="max-w-md text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                Construyendo el futuro de <span class="text-white italic">FlyxNodes</span>. Mezclando la precisión del código con la calidez de un buen tereré de mañana. 
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                <a href="#proyectos" class="group flex items-center space-x-3 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-tighter">
                    <span>Explorar proyectos</span>
                    <span class="p-4 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-black transition-all">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
